$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: anti-(E)-Butyl
7-hydroxy-6,8-dimethyl-5-methylenenon-2-enoate (4a) According to the
general procedure A the catalyst was prepared from zinc iodide (32 mg,
0.10 mmol), zinc dust (7 mg, 0.10 mmol) and CoBr2(dppe) (31 mg, 0.05
mmol) in 0.5 mL dichloromethane. Then n-butyl acrylate (0.08 mL, 0.55
mmol) and isoprenylpinacolboronic ester 1 (107 mg, 0.55 mmol) were added
to the reaction mixture which subsequently was stirred for 16 h. After
dilution and cooling to 0 °C isobutyraldehyde (0.05 mL, 0.50 mmol) was
added and the reaction mixture was stirred at this temperature for 1 h.
After quenching with triethanolamine (0.08 mL, 0.55 mmol), work up and
purification by flash column chromatography (silica gel,
pentane/diethylether 2:1) the desired product 4a was obtained.The dr was
determined with the signals at 6.97 and 6.82 ppm. anti-(2E,8E)-Butyl
7-hydroxy-6-methyl-5-methylene-9-phenylnona-2,8-dienoate (4m) According
to the general procedure A the catalyst was prepared from zinc iodide (32
mg, 0.10 mmol), zinc dust (7 mg, 0.10 mmol) and CoBr2(dppe) (31 mg, 0.05
mmol) in 0.5 mL dichloromethane. Then n-butyl acrylate (0.08 mL, 0.55
mmol) and isoprenylpinacolboronic ester 1 (107 mg, 0.55 mmol) were added
to the reaction mixture which subsequently was stirred for 16 h. After
dilution and cooling to 0 °C (E)-cinnamaldehyde (0.06 mL, 0.50 mmol) was
added and the reaction mixture was stirred at this temperature for 1 h.
After quenching with triethanolamine (0.08 mL, 0.55 mmol), work up and
purification by flash column chromatography (silica gel, pentane/diethyl
ether 2:1) the desired product 4m was obtained.The dr was determined with
the signals at 6.99 and 6.83 ppm. A colorless oil (148 mg, 0.45 mmol,
90%, dr 95:5). 1H NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz): δ = 7.41-7.37 (m, 2H), 7.35-7.30
(m, 2H), 7.27-7.22 (m, 1H), 6.99 (dt, J = 15.5, 7.2 Hz, 1H), 6.61 (d, J =
15.9 Hz, 1H), 6.18 (dd, J = 15.9, 7.2 Hz, 1H), 5.89 (dt, J = 15.6, 1.5
Hz, 1H), 5.06 (s, 1H), 4.97 (s, 1H), 4.14 (t, J = 6.6 Hz, 3H), 2.98 (d, J
= 7.2 Hz, 2H), 2.44-2.35 (m, 1H), 1.95 (bs, 1H), 1.69-1.60 (m, 2H),
1.46-1.34 (m, 2H), 1.06 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 3H), 0.94 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 3H).
13C NMR (CDCl3, 75 MHz): δ = 166.4, 148.0, 146.0, 136.6, 132.0, 130.1,
128.6, 127.7, 126.5, 123.2, 113.9, 75.3, 64.2, 47.0, 36.8, 30.7, 19.2,
16.2, 13.7. IR (film, cm-1): 3467, 3082, 3027, 2962, 2874, 1718, 1653,
1600, 1578, 1494, 1451, 1387, 1277, 1213, 1163, 1067, 1028, 968, 905,
846, 794, 751, 694. HRMS (APCI): calculated for C21H28O3H: m/z =
329.2107; found m/z = 329.2107.
