$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: anti-(E)-Butyl
7-hydroxy-6,8-dimethyl-5-methylenenon-2-enoate (4a) According to the
general procedure A the catalyst was prepared from zinc iodide (32 mg,
0.10 mmol), zinc dust (7 mg, 0.10 mmol) and CoBr2(dppe) (31 mg, 0.05
mmol) in 0.5 mL dichloromethane. Then n-butyl acrylate (0.08 mL, 0.55
mmol) and isoprenylpinacolboronic ester 1 (107 mg, 0.55 mmol) were added
to the reaction mixture which subsequently was stirred for 16 h. After
dilution and cooling to 0 °C isobutyraldehyde (0.05 mL, 0.50 mmol) was
added and the reaction mixture was stirred at this temperature for 1 h.
After quenching with triethanolamine (0.08 mL, 0.55 mmol), work up and
purification by flash column chromatography (silica gel,
pentane/diethylether 2:1) the desired product 4a was obtained.The dr was
determined with the signals at 6.97 and 6.82 ppm. anti-(2E,8E)-butyl
7-hydroxy-6,8-dimethyl-5-methylene-9-phenylnona-2,8-dienoate (4n)
According to the general procedure A the catalyst was prepared from zinc
iodide (64 mg, 0.2 mmol), zinc dust (13 mg, 0.2 mmol) and CoBr2(dppe) (62
mg, 0.1 mmol) in 1.0 mL dichloromethane. Then n-butyl acrylate (0.16 mL,
1.1 mmol) and isoprenylpinacolboronic ester 1 (213 mg, 1.1 mmol) were
added to the reaction mixture which subsequently was stirred for 16 h.
After dilution and cooling to 0 °C (E)-2-methyl-3-phenylacrylaldehyde
(0.14 mL, 1.0 mmol) was added and the reaction mixture was stirred at
this temperature for 1 h. After quenching with triethanolamine (0.15 mL,
1.1 mmol), work up and purification by flash column chromatography
(silica gel, pentane/diethyl ether 2:1) the desired product 4n was
obtained.The dr was determined with the signals at 7.01 and 6.83 ppm. A
colorless oil (215 mg, 0.87 mmol, 87%, dr 93:7). 1NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz): δ
= 7.37-7.20 (m, 5H), 7.01 (dt, J = 15.5, 7.2 Hz, 1H), 6.49 (s, 1H), 5.91
(dt, J = 15.5, 1.5 Hz, 1H), 5.10 (s, 1H), 4.98 (s, 1H), 4.15 (t, J = 6.6
Hz, 2H), 3.99 (dd, J = 9.1, 2.3 Hz, 1H), 2.99 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 2H),
2.55-2.45 (m, 1H), 1.90 (d, J = 2.6 Hz, 1H), 1.88 (d, J = 1.5 Hz, 3H),
1.67-1.60 (m, 2H), 1.47-1.34 (m, 2H), 0.99 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 3H), 0.94 (t,
J = 7.4 Hz, 3H). 13C NMR (CDCl3, 75 MHz): δ = 166.4, 148.4, 146.0, 137.9,
137.3, 129.0, 128.5, 128.1, 126.6, 123.2, 114.0, 80.9, 64.2, 44.7, 36.1,
30.7, 19.2, 16.8, 13.7, 12.5. IR (film, cm-1): 3482, 3080, 3024, 2962,
2933, 2874, 1719, 1653, 1600, 1492, 1454, 1384, 1312, 1277, 1213, 1163,
1116, 1068, 1024, 916, 862, 752, 700. HRMS (APCI): calculated for
C22H30O3H: m/z = 343.2265; found m/z = 343.2265.
