$DATUM Compound S-8 (1.0 g, 5.87 mmol) was dissolved in THF 15 mL, and cooled to
0 °C. To this solution was added slowly PhMgCl (7.6 ml, 1 M in THF), and
the resulting solution was stirred for 2 min at 0 °C before addition of
water. The solution was extracted with ethyl acetate (three times),
concentrated under reduced pressure, and eluted through a silica column
(hexane/ethyl acetate: 10/1) to afford compound S-41 (1.22 g , 5.57 mmol,
95%).
