$DATUM (Z)-4,4-Dimethyl-1,2-diphenyl-1-hydroxy-3-trifluoro-methylpent-2-ene
(4a). A solution of enol ether 3 (220 mg, 1 mmol), tert-butyllithium (1.4
mL of a 1.5 M solution in hexanes, 2.1 mmol), and TMEDA (490 mg, 2.1
mmol) in hexane (10 mL), after addition of benzaldehyde (132 mg, 1.2
mmol), afforded, after workup and purification, the alcohol 4a (320 mg,
95%). IR (neat) 3650, 1670 cm-1; 19F NMR δ - 47.8 (s); 1H NMR δ 1.0 (s, 9
H), 6.1 (s, CHOH), 6.2 (s, OH), 7.1 (m, 10H); 13C RMN δ 28.7, 37.7, 72.7
(q, 4 JCF = 4.6 Hz, CHOH), 125.6 (q, 1 JCF =282 Hz, CF3), 126.2, 126.6,
127.3, 127.7, 130.4, 131;0, 136.2, , 136;7 (q, 2 JCF = 23.3 Hz, CF3-C),
140.6, 148.5 (q, 3 JCF = 3 Hz); Anal. Calcd for C20H21F3O: C 71.86, H
6.29. Found: C 71.78, H 6.42.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective
