$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (E)-1-Fluoro-4-phenyl-1-(phenylsulfonyl)but-3-en-2-ol (25b) Under N2
atmosphere, into a Schlenk tube containing cinnamaldehyde 24 (80 mg, 0.6
mmol) and PhSO2CH2F 2 ( 52 mg, 0.3 mmol) in THF-HMPA (2 mL/0.2 mL) at
-78°C, was added dropwise a THF solution (0.3 mL) of LHMDS (0.3 mmol).
The reaction mixture was then stirred vigorously at -78 °C for 30 min,
followed by adding a saturated NH4Cl water solution (5 mL) at this
temperature. The solution mixture was extracted with EtOAc (10 mL3), and
the combined organic phase was dried over MgSO4. After the removal of
volatile solvents under vacuum, the crude product was further purified by
silica gel column chromatography (petroleum ether/EtOAc 5:1 as eluent)
give product 25b 85 mg (92% yield). Pale yellow oil. For a 1:1 mixture of
isomers:. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 2.94 (s, 0.5H)/3.23 (s, 0.5H),
4.82-5.24 (m, 2H), 6.20 (dd, J = 17, 6.5 Hz, 0.5H)/ 6.26 (dd, J = 17, 6.5
Hz, 0.5H), 6.77 (d, J = 17 Hz, 0.5H)/ 6.82 (d, J = 17 Hz, 0.5H),
7.22-7.42 (m, 5H), 7.56-7.66 (m, 2H), 7.69-7.77 (m, 1H), 7.80 (d, J = 7.6
Hz 2H). 19F NMR (282 MHz, CDCl3): δ -192.2 (dd, J = 48, 22 Hz,
0.5F)/-182.1 (dd, J = 48, 8 Hz, 0.5F). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ 69.2
(d, J = 18 Hz)/69.4 (d, J = 18 Hz), 101.7 (d, J = 225 Hz)/ 102.0 (d, J =
225 Hz), 123.5/123.9 (d, J = 2 Hz), 126.7/126.8, 128.2/128.3,
128.5/128.6, 129.2/129.3, 129.4, 134.0/134.4, 134.7/134.8, 135.4/135.7,
135.8/135.9. HRMS (MALDI): m/z calcd for C16H15O3FSNa (M+Na+) 329.06182,
found 329.0626. MS (ESI, m/z): 324.2 (M+ NH4+). IR(KBr): 3495, 1449,
1328, 1156, 1072 cm-1.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective, reaction without HMPA at lower temp. gave poorer yield
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
